# Worker base URL (no trailing slash). Build-time config. Production: leave empty (same-origin /api/*).
# Dev: e.g. http://localhost:8787 (wrangler dev) or your own custom domain.
VITE_API_URL=
# API_TOKEN is a Worker secret. It is not set here, and /records, /txrequests, and /settings do not accept it.
# Same-origin plan: leave VITE_API_URL empty (the app then calls /api/* on its own origin).
